          <p style="color:white;font-size:13px;opacity:0.9;">购任意产品免费星球试用 · 仅限前<span style="color:#C9A96E;font-weight:700;">50 spots</span></p>
        </div>

        <button onclick="showPayment('9.9')" style="display:block;width:100%;margin-top:12px;padding:12px;background:#0F2B46;color:white;border:none;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;">¥9.9 购买报告 →</button>
